{"id": "wwdc2017-819", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2017/819", "wordCount": 1259, "segments": [{"start": 22.0, "text": "You have a global audience,"}, {"start": 25.0, "text": "the world is increasingly"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "interconnected, people travel"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "and when they do they use apps"}, {"start": 32.0, "text": "to orient themselves in new"}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "places and figure out what to"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "do, where to eat and how to get"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "around."}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "And people move for all sorts of"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "reasons, so in any given place"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "you're likely to find people"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "from different countries,"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "cultures and language groups."}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "And here at WWDC, we are part of"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "a group representing 75"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "different countries."}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "So why design for this global"}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "audience?"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "First and most importantly, for"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "a better user experience."}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "Language and symbols are"}, {"start": 69.0, "text": "grounded in cultural context so"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "not all of us interpret things"}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "in the same way."}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "It's important of course, to"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "make sure that your words and"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "artwork aren't offensive to your"}, {"start": 79.0, "text": "users, but don't stop there."}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "Carefully considering your"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "global audience can help make"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "your app as useful and appealing"}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "to as many people as possible."}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "And thinking this way sets you"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "up to grow."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "The App Store is available"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "around the world so people from"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "any country that you've enabled"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "in iTunes Connect can view and"}, {"start": 101.0, "text": "download your app."}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "Whether your app is only in one"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "language right now or you're"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "already in multiple markets the"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "principles we'll discuss are"}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "relevant to you no matter what."}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "So, let's get started."}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "First, make a plan."}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "Think about your strategic"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "goals, which countries and"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "languages are next on your"}, {"start": 121.0, "text": "roadmap, if you have one"}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "already, and don't forget to"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "take a look at your app"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "analytics in iTunes Connect"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "that's some useful information,"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "you might find something there"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "that's surprising."}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "Next, identify your user groups"}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "and think about how best to"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "communicate with them."}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "Can you get by with some minor"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "changes to your app."}, {"start": 142.0, "text": "Is it time to think seriously"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "about a major localization"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "effort."}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "Use this information to"}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "prioritize your important"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "localization work and think"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "about ways to streamline."}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "Make sure that you have"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "translations for your key terms"}, {"start": 158.0, "text": "before you need them and if"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "you're going to have a second"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "set of artwork for example for a"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "different market get it all done"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "at the same time."}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "So, let's discuss some key"}, {"start": 169.0, "text": "considerations related to"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "language."}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "When terms can be used more or"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "less interchangeably in your"}, {"start": 177.0, "text": "app's primary language is there"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "one choice that's very similar"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "to other languages."}, {"start": 183.0, "text": "For example, picture and photo"}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "are more or less the same in"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "English, but look at the"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "difference in these other"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "languages."}, {"start": 189.0, "text": "Photo is the clear winner for"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "multilingual clarity."}, {"start": 195.0, "text": "If you have the resources to"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "fully translate your app go for"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "it, but if not prioritize."}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "Help your users orient"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "themselves with headings and"}, {"start": 208.0, "text": "titles."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "Make sure that the important"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "information from your"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "instructions is conveyed and"}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "that commonly used terms are"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "clear."}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "Finally, make sure that users"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "can read error messages just in"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "case something goes wrong."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "Think about informal language"}, {"start": 229.0, "text": "too."}, {"start": 231.0, "text": "You may choose to include slang,"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "very informal words or phrases"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "or figures of speech, words or"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "phrases that are not intended to"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "be taken literally."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "Let's look at a couple of"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "examples."}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "I am a native Californian and I"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "might say oh sick, you crush it"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "or sweet, that rocked."}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "But here I'm not talking about"}, {"start": 255.0, "text": "illnesses or desserts just"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "saying that someone did"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "something particularly well."}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "I may also say it's raining cats"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "and dogs."}, {"start": 269.0, "text": "I love the last one. Or I'm hungry enough to eat a"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "horse."}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "This kind of language adds"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "character to an app, so I'm"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "certainly not saying never to"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "use it."}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "But if you do, do a quick check"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "to make sure that it's not"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "offensive and be sure to offer"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "contextual clues so that even if"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "a user isn't totally sure what"}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "you mean they can still figure"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "it out."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "Let's talk now about symbology"}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "and do a quick exercise."}, {"start": 297.0, "text": "Put your hand up and count one,"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "two, three."}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "Okay now hold that and take a"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "look around."}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "How many people have their"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "thumb, index finger and third"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "finger extended?"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "How about index, third and ring"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "or maybe something else"}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "entirely?"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "This is a great example of the"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "wide variation in gestures for"}, {"start": 324.0, "text": "something as simple as counting"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "to three."}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "If you choose to include"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "gestures in your app make sure"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "that it means what you intend"}, {"start": 332.0, "text": "and plan ahead to localize when"}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "appropriate."}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "Now let's talk about localized"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "and globalized iconography with"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "an example from our Maps app."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "We're about to look at the set"}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "of icons that we use to"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "represent an important feature"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "in different countries."}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "So, who knows what this"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "represents?"}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "Okay a couple hands."}, {"start": 356.0, "text": "How about this?"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "Getting warmer all right, many"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "more hands."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "And about this?"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "All right, just about everybody."}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "So, this is the logo of Japan"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "Post which we use to represent"}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "post offices, but only in Japan."}, {"start": 375.0, "text": "This is the postal horn which we"}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "use in Sweden, Turkey,"}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "Luxembourg and 28 other"}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "countries."}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "And finally, in every other"}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "country we use this simple"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "recognizable letter outline to"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "symbolize the post office."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "I like this example because I"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "think it represents a nice"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "spectrum of local to global"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "iconography."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "And there's really no right"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "answer here, but it's an"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "important question for you to"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "consider, exactly how specific"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "do you want to be with your"}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "symbols."}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "When depicting people keep in"}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "mind that more detailed icons"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "may exclude some of your users,"}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "but that simpler glyphs like"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "this silhouette are much more"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "general and maybe a better"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "choice. And as a bonus, we include this"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "glyph in UIKit so that artwork"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "is already available to you."}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "Let's talk about our final"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "consideration now, associations."}, {"start": 432.0, "text": "What does this owl make you"}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "think of?"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "If you grew up in an"}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "English-speaking context you may"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "associate owls with wisdom, but"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "in much of the Arabic speaking"}, {"start": 443.0, "text": "world owls can be associated"}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "with bad luck or even death."}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "So, make sure that your"}, {"start": 448.0, "text": "associations are what you"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "expect. I hope I have helped you to"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "think further or start thinking"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "about designing for your global"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "audience."}, {"start": 458.0, "text": "Now let's look at some"}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "resources."}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "First, if you can travel to the"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "places where your customers live"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "I hope you will, but not"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "everyone can travel."}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "Never fear there are other"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "resources much closer to home."}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "Could you conduct focus groups"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "either formal focus groups with"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "participants selected based on"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "their primary language, cultural"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "background or other"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "characteristics or possibly more"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "informal focus groups where you"}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "offer snacks to friends or"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "family in exchange for their"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "feedback on your designs?"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "You may be able to draw on"}, {"start": 493.0, "text": "personal or professional"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "contacts for this kind of"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "feedback as well."}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "And now moving to the web,"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "language learning, translation"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "and travel funds offer a wealth"}, {"start": 503.0, "text": "of knowledge about language and"}, {"start": 505.0, "text": "symbol use and expectations"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "around the world."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "And web and image searches can"}, {"start": 510.0, "text": "give you a lot of this information too."}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "Books and articles can be"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "helpful as well, look for"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "keywords like global design,"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "user experience, intercultural"}, {"start": 520.0, "text": "or cross-cultural communication,"}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "visual design and tips for"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "travelers, businesspeople and"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "interpreters."}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "Finally, don't forget about"}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "libraries where you can find"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "some of these publications, as"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "well as map and document"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "collections with rich"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "information."}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "So, to wrap it all up, this is"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "not an all or nothing design"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "problem, smart changes can go a"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "long way toward making your app"}, {"start": 548.0, "text": "more useful for more people."}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "Use the resources that are"}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "available to you to create a"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "great user experience and lay"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "the groundwork for expansion."}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "You can do this."}]}